Odd numbers found when writing first denominator and then numerator of each element of the 1/3-Pascal triangle (by row).

The 82 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A046556

